Do not serve a device or pipe as a folder's settings file.

serveFile follows symlinks and opens a read stream for any path whose stat
succeeds. A folder settings file that links to /dev/zero or a named pipe blocks
the page's synchronous settings read or holds libuv worker threads in open().
Check stat.isFile() before opening the read stream so only regular files and
symlinks to regular files are served.

